                        "text": "Incorrect. The pH is calculated from the equilibrium concentration of hydronium. To find the equilibrium concentration, write the acid dissociation reaction and the "
                      },
                      {
                        "em": true,
                        "text": "K"
                      },
                      {
                        "em": true,
                        "sub": true,
                        "text": "a"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": " expression. Use the reaction stoichiometry and an ICE (Initial-Change-Equilibrium) table of concentrations to calculate changes in concentrations and equilibrium concentrations. Remember that the table has three rows:"
                      }
                    ],
                    "id": "ivwj4901wk90rtk",
                    "type": "p"
                  },
                  {
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "text": "1. The top row shows initial concentrations, which may be zero for some species."
                      }
                    ],
                    "id": "5f4820g7qvv5xa8",
                    "type": "p"
                  },
                  {
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "text": "2. The middle row shows changes, usually shown as -"
                      },
                      {
                        "em": true,
                        "text": "x"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": " for reactants and +"
                      },
                      {
                        "em": true,
                        "text": "x"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": " for products (depending on stoichiometry), in concentrations that must occur for all species in order for the reaction to reach equilibrium."
                      }
                    ],
                    "id": "2k0lnqsh5ogomm9",
                    "type": "p"
                  },
                  {
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "text": "3. The bottom row shows final equilibrium concentrations of all species when the reaction has reached equilibrium."
                      }
                    ],
                    "id": "sd2z1c1oovaz3lb",
                    "type": "p"
                  },
                  {
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "text": "Then use algebra to solve for changes in concentrations and final equilibrium concentrations. Remember that the algebra can be simplified for small values of "
                      },
                      {
                        "em": true,
                        "text": "K"
                      },
                      {
                        "em": true,
                        "sub": true,
                        "text": "a"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": " (usually less than 1×10"
                      },
                      {
                        "sup": true,
                        "text": "-3"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "); otherwise, for intermediate values of "
                      },
                      {
                        "em": true,
                        "text": "K"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": ", the quadratic equation should be used."
                      }
                    ],
                    "id": "1frwu881us43auv",
                    "type": "p"
                  },
                  {
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "text": "Finally, use the equation relating pH and [H"
                      },
                      {
                        "sub": true,
                        "text": "3"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "O"
                      },
                      {
                        "sup": true,
                        "text": "+"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "] to calculate pH."
                      }
                    ],
                    "id": "u62xaclv6g88k7a",
                    "type": "p"
                  }
                ],
